\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0 O, Jesus Christ, the Lamb of  God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 my Saviour and my Lord;
\par my sins are truly very great
\par but your grace covers all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  I humble my self in thy sight,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 in forms of ash and sand.
\par \cf1 I plead to you for forgiveness\cf0 
\par deliver me from sin.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Destroy the love I have for sin
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 in all my heart today,
\par and take your love and compassion
\par to draw me to your side.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Come, take my hand and hold me tight
\par     That I may not fall down;
\par      So let me do what pleases you
\par      And what is good for you.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Come into me and cleanse my heart,
\par be my master always.
\par that all my mind and all my heart
\par shall evermore be yours.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

